  "recipeId": "butter-paneer",
  "name": "Butter Paneer (Paneer Butter Masala)",
  "servings": 4,
  "notes": [
    "Start with a block of fresh, soft paneer and with dried fenugreek leaves already crushed. Making the cheese is outside this graph.",
    "Use a white onion, 3 whole cloves, 12 raw unsalted cashews, 3 tbsp heavy cream and the listed 3/4 tsp salt. One counted piece of cinnamon is a 1/2-inch segment.",
    "This version omits the optional tomato paste, extra garam masala and cilantro garnish. Rice and naan are outside the graph.",
    "Melt the butter after blending so the purée is ready to add immediately after the ground chilies bloom in the same pan."
  ],
  "outputs": [
    "butter_paneer"
  ],
